 your Silkworm destiny.\n\nFor a casual look into the making of these games, follow on TikTok: danger_dom_", "short_description": "Walking past a Silkworm, do you ever find yourself wondering.. what would life be like if ~I~ were a Silkworm? Wonder no more! Silkworm is an open-world Action-Adventure game set in expansive Silky City. Jump, Swing, Climb, Zipline your way through the city, and fulfill your Silkworm destiny.\n\nFor a casual look into the making of these games, follow on TikTok: danger_dom_\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/sol5studios-privacypolicy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sol 5 Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://discord.gg/YHKCQP6REp", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "EXPLORATION", "FLYING"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "27493791006911511"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974879_233854448526598_955641987027335647_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Fcxs5BlHsh0Q7kNvwFJqRuJ&_nc_oc=AdrFkf3xk4fcYoxD5oSzRXt6p-LIKTVi7-Z82THyr1_hEIRKM4-aZA6ozJo1jUaMStk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-zvNH4gRKYIHbwqLiVbknKkrzvvUpmuznMTglYJpQ3Mw&oe=6A467347"}, "is_concept